  "published": "2026-06-10T17:52:36.307Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking beta: v3 now targets .NET 8+ only and the beta may continue to introduce breaking changes while the API is finalized, simplify execution to a single async ExecuteAsync<T>(RestRequest, CancellationToken) path, add RestRequest factories, replace context-dependent Parameters with QueryParameters and explicit Content/PostForm support, remove synchronous Execute<T>, remove sync-over-async response construction, remove legacy response formatter path, require content-aware async formatting, copy response headers/content headers, support absolute URLs, normalize BuildUrl segment joining to avoid duplicate slashes, make request-building hooks mutate-only, harden RestRequest defaults, clarify default HttpClient lifetime with a shared process-lifetime internal client, keep injected HttpClient instances caller-owned, remove protected Client access, add protected SendAsync as the transport extension point, make the authenticator API mutate only the supplied HttpRequestMessage and return void, add configurable diagnostic body capture with opt-in explicit HttpContent request body capture, keep serialized request bodies and response content captured by default, add MaxCapturedContentLength for stored diagnostic body strings, and expand model, hook, formatter exception, and URL normalization test coverage.",
